## 5. Steganography

| Command | What it does |
|---------|--------------|
| `exiftool image.jpg` | Checks metadata fields for hidden text. |
| `strings image.jpg \| tail` | Looks for text appended to the end of an image. |
| `binwalk -e image.png` | Extracts files hidden inside the image. |
| `steghide info image.jpg` | Reports whether data may be embedded (asks for a passphrase). |
| `steghide extract -sf image.jpg` | Extracts hidden data using a passphrase (`-sf` = stego file). |
| `zsteg image.png` | Checks PNG/BMP files for LSB-hidden data. |
| Stegsolve / online image viewers | Flip through colour planes and filters to reveal hidden patterns. |
| Audacity / Sonic Visualiser | View an audio file's spectrogram for hidden images or text. |

