## 6. OSINT

| Tool / Command | What it does |
|----------------|--------------|
| `whois example.com` | Shows public domain registration info. |
| `dig example.com ANY` | Queries DNS records for a domain. |
| `nslookup example.com` | Simple DNS lookup. |
| Google operators (`site:`, `filetype:`, `intitle:`, `"exact phrase"`) | Narrow search results. |
| Wayback Machine (`web.archive.org`) | Views older saved versions of web pages. |
| `exiftool photo.jpg` | Reads location/time metadata from a photo. |
| Reverse image search | Finds where an image appears online. |
| Google Maps / Street View | Verifies locations visible in a photo. |

**OSINT ethics:** stay on the information the challenge points to. Do not dig into private individuals beyond what the challenge requires, and do not publish personal data.

